  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Meaningful Youth Participation in Political and Peace Processes in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater and more meaningful participation of youth in political and peace processes to end the war in Sudan. Special focus on inclusion and participation of young women in the political process.

Outcomes
1.	Youth have strengthened capacity to act, participate and influence in Sudan 
2.	Youth mobilize and organize to prepare for joint actions and engagement
3.	Youth are active in outreach and engagement with their communities
4.	Youth actively participate, advocate and influence decision-makers</narrative>
  </description>
